### Asset Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@assetCode = USDC
@assetIssuer = GA5ZSEJYB37JRC5AVCIA5MOP4RHTM335X2KGX3IHOJAPP5RE34K4KZVN
@apiKey = 

### Get Asset Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetCode}}/{{assetIssuer}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Asset Price
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetCode}}/{{assetIssuer}}/price
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Asset Price History
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetCode}}/{{assetIssuer}}/price-history?days=30
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Asset Holders
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetCode}}/{{assetIssuer}}/holders?limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Asset Distribution
GET {{baseUrl}}/asset/{{assetCode}}/{{assetIssuer}}/distribution
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Assets Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets?limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Assets by Issuer
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets?issuer={{assetIssuer}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Assets by Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets?code={{assetCode}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
